# No catch-all rewrite.
#
# This is a PRERENDERED site: every doc route is emitted as a static
# <slug>/index.html by scripts/prerender.mjs, and Cloudflare Pages serves those
# directly for both /slug and /slug/. Requests with no matching static asset
# fall through to 404.html (also prerendered as the SPA shell), which boots the
# client router to resolve client-only routes or render the NotFoundPage.
#
# The former `/* /index.html 200` rule rewrote EVERY request to the empty index
# shell, shadowing all prerendered pages and breaking hard navigation / F5.
